  "notes": "Layer has exactly the two GoDurham Connect zones (North Durham, East Durham); nothing dropped. Zone names shortened from the layer NAME field (e.g. 'GoDurham Connect North Durham Zone'). Eligibility quote: 'Anyone can use GoDurham Connect. There are no eligibility requirements.' The page conflicts on age ('Ages 12+ can ride alone' vs 'Children ages 12 and under must ride with an adult'); the narrower reading is used: 13 and older alone, 12 and under with an adult. Pickup method is not stated in the source notes, so it is left out. The old service page godurhamtransit.org/godurham-connect now redirects to a news article. GTFS has no Flex; re-check if GoDurham publishes GTFS-Flex."
